{
 "caps": [
  {
   "t": 0.0,
   "text": "How many apps does it"
  },
  {
   "t": 1.14,
   "text": "take to run a creative agency?"
  },
  {
   "t": 3.46,
   "text": "Depends."
  },
  {
   "t": 3.76,
   "text": "What do you need to do?"
  },
  {
   "t": 5.44,
   "text": "Find clients."
  },
  {
   "t": 6.08,
   "text": "Manage projects."
  },
  {
   "t": 6.94,
   "text": "Talk to clients."
  },
  {
   "t": 7.84,
   "text": "Get designs approved."
  },
  {
   "t": 8.98,
   "text": "Chase payments."
  },
  {
   "t": 10.22,
   "text": "So... a lot of apps?"
  },
  {
   "t": 11.82,
   "text": "Way too many."
  },
  {
   "t": 13.04,
   "text": "Where are your leads?"
  },
  {
   "t": 14.44,
   "text": "In a CRM."
  },
  {
   "t": 15.46,
   "text": "Projects?"
  },
  {
   "t": 16.54,
   "text": "A project management tool."
  },
  {
   "t": 18.42,
   "text": "Feedback?"
  },
  {
   "t": 19.24,
   "text": "Email. And a separate proofing app."
  },
  {
   "t": 21.2,
   "text": "Client conversations?"
  },
  {
   "t": 22.8,
   "text": "Somewhere else."
  },
  {
   "t": 23.86,
   "text": "Proposals, invoices, payments?"
  },
  {
   "t": 25.82,
   "text": "More tools."
  },
  {
   "t": 26.38,
   "text": "And none of them seem"
  },
  {
   "t": 27.3,
   "text": "to know what's happening"
  },
  {
   "t": 28.16,
   "text": "in the others."
  },
  {
   "t": 28.7,
   "text": "What if they"
  },
  {
   "t": 29.94,
   "text": "were all connected?"
  },
  {
   "t": 31.34,
   "text": "Meet Nodstage."
  },
  {
   "t": 32.62,
   "text": "One connected workspace"
  },
  {
   "t": 33.7,
   "text": "built around how"
  },
  {
   "t": 34.52,
   "text": "creative studios actually work."
  },
  {
   "t": 36.68,
   "text": "Okay. Where do I start?"
  },
  {
   "t": 38.14,
   "text": "With your leads."
  },
  {
   "t": 38.94,
   "text": "Inquiries, discovery calls,"
  },
  {
   "t": 40.18,
   "text": "follow-ups and proposals,"
  },
  {
   "t": 41.16,
   "text": "in one pipeline."
  },
  {
   "t": 42.62,
   "text": "And when a deal is won?"
  },
  {
   "t": 43.82,
   "text": "It becomes a project."
  },
  {
   "t": 44.96,
   "text": "Tasks, deadlines and your team's workload."
  },
  {
   "t": 47.18,
   "text": "What about the client?"
  },
  {
   "t": 48.46,
   "text": "They get their own branded portal."
  },
  {
   "t": 50.14,
   "text": "They review proofs,"
  },
  {
   "t": 50.96,
   "text": "leave visual feedback and approve."
  },
  {
   "t": 53.0,
   "text": "And revisions?"
  },
  {
   "t": 53.94,
   "text": "Managed right there."
  },
  {
   "t": 55.02,
   "text": "Extra work becomes a change order."
  },
  {
   "t": 56.46,
   "text": "Then I still need an invoicing app."
  },
  {
   "t": 59.0,
   "text": "No."
  },
  {
   "t": 59.06,
   "text": "Invoices and payments live here too."
  },
  {
   "t": 61.04,
   "text": "So do your calendar,"
  },
  {
   "t": 61.8,
   "text": "video messages,"
  },
  {
   "t": 62.72,
   "text": "forms, templates and automations."
  },
  {
   "t": 64.8,
   "text": "And testimonials?"
  },
  {
   "t": 66.16,
   "text": "Requested when the client approves."
  },
  {
   "t": 68.2,
   "text": "So I don't need to"
  },
  {
   "t": 68.86,
   "text": "keep jumping between"
  },
  {
   "t": 69.68,
   "text": "all those tools?"
  },
  {
   "t": 71.16,
   "text": "That's the whole point."
  },
  {
   "t": 72.16,
   "text": "Less switching."
  },
  {
   "t": 72.76,
   "text": "Less chasing."
  },
  {
   "t": 73.92,
   "text": "And it's free to start?"
  },
  {
   "t": 75.18,
   "text": "Free to start."
  },
  {
   "t": 75.98,
   "text": "Sign up at nodstage.com."
  }
 ],
